+### Capturing raw packets
+
+`JoyconConnection` logs each packet whose input bytes changed (buttons `0x03..0x09`, sticks,
+triggers), under the tag `J2Raw`. IMU, counter and small stick jitter are filtered out. It is off
+until enabled, and takes effect without restarting the app:
+
+```
+adb shell setprop log.tag.J2Raw DEBUG
+adb logcat -s J2Raw
+adb shell setprop log.tag.J2Raw INFO   # off again
+```
+
+Each line is `[side name] btn=… L=x,y R=x,y trig=l,r pressed=… len=… raw=<hex>`, the decoded fields
+before stick calibration. Press one control at a time to map a bit.
+
 ## Player LEDs
 
